OL,3,GNEWSAMajor route closed after serious
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major route linking the south coast
OL,7,Fwith the Midlands remains closed in one
OL,8,Fdirection following a crash.
OL,10,FThe A34 near Winchester, Hampshire, has
OL,11,Fbeen shut southbound after what
OL,12,FNational Highways said was a "serious
OL,13,Fcollision".
OL,15,FThe closure is in place between the
OL,16,FA303 Bullington Interchange and
OL,17,Fjunction 9 of the M3 near Sutton
OL,18,FScotney while recovery work continues.
OL,20,FA diversion has been put in place
OL,21,Ffollowing the incident, which prompted
OL,22,Fa large emergency services response.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
